&quot;Detalles\&quot;,\&quot;status\&quot;:1,\&quot;orden\&quot;:2}],\&quot;requirements\&quot;:[{\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;\u00bfQu\u00e9 necesito para hacer el tr\u00e1mite?\&quot;,\&quot;status\&quot;:1,\&quot;orden\&quot;:3}],\&quot;validity\&quot;:[{\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;\u00bfQu\u00e9 vigencia tiene?\&quot;,\&quot;status\&quot;:1,\&quot;orden\&quot;:4}],\&quot;howto\&quot;:[{\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;\u00bfC\u00f3mo y d\u00f3nde hago el tr\u00e1mite?\&quot;,\&quot;status\&quot;:1,\&quot;orden\&quot;:5}],\&quot;cost\&quot;:[{\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el costo del tr\u00e1mite?\&quot;,\&quot;status\&quot;:1,\&quot;orden\&quot;:6}],\&quot;legal\&quot;:[{\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;Marco Legal\&quot;,\&quot;status\&quot;:1,\&quot;orden\&quot;:7}]}]}&quot;,&quot;metadata_newpages&quot;:null,&quot;redirect_to&quot;:119860,&quot;guid&quot;:&quot;9791-devolucion-del-dinero-de-un-bono-de-atencion-de-salud-o-programa-medico-de-fonasa&quot;,&quot;howto&quot;:true,&quot;pivot&quot;:{&quot;page_id&quot;:9793,&quot;similar_page_id&quot;:9791}}],&quot;hitosvida&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:12,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Acceder a salud p\u00fablica&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Afiliaci\u00f3n a Fonasa, incorporaci\u00f3n de cargas, bonos y programas m\u00e9dicos.&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;user_creator&quot;:5,&quot;active&quot;:true,&quot;tramites&quot;:&quot;3976,9631,9635,9620,9633,28964,9629,41345,5224,45209,5241,5425,7762,3511,9795,9793,9791,50399,39342,53052,44377,8949,4930,62629,76028,3529,33809,679,4954,37853&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2020-07-20T20:19:43.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2022-11-02T20:04:40.000000Z&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:&quot;salud&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:&quot;doctor.svg&quot;,&quot;border&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;order&quot;:5,&quot;deleted_at&quot;:null,&quot;custom_title&quot;:&quot;salud&quot;,&quot;custom_meta&quot;:&quot;Revisa c\u00f3mo acceder a la salud p\u00fablica&quot;,&quot;keywords&quot;:&quot;afiliarse a fonasa, comprar bono, comprar bono fonasa, bono PAD, inscribir una carga, entrar a fonasa, atenci\u00f3n de urgencias, pr\u00e9stamo de fonasa, AUGE, GES, consulta m\u00e9dica, valor de un bono, devoluci\u00f3n de un bono, tratamiento de fertilidad, licencia m\u00e9dica, licencia rechazada, programa m\u00e9dico, afiliar una carga, ingresar a fonasa, ser parte de fonasa, agregar una carga, incorporar una carga, carga familiar, carga de salud, agregar a un familiar a fonasa, PAD, carga, pagar fonasa, consultorio, atenci\u00f3n m\u00e9dica, bono, exceso de dep\u00f3sito&quot;,&quot;open&quot;:true,&quot;pivot&quot;:{&quot;page_id&quot;:9793,&quot;hitos_vida_id&quot;:12}}]},&quot;related_pages&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:3430,&quot;order&quot;:3,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;C\u00e9dula de identidad&quot;,&quot;alias&quot;:&quot;cedula-de-identidad&quot;,&quot;featured&quot;:false,&quot;image&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;objective&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Documento que acredita la identidad de una persona chilena. Contiene tu nombre completo, Rol \u00danico Nacional (RUN), sexo, foto, firma y huella dactilar.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Para que &lt;strong&gt;incluya tu profesi\u00f3n&lt;\/strong&gt;, debes estar inscrito o inscrita en el &lt;span style=\&quot;font-weight: 600 !important;\&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;[[3391]]\&quot; target=\&quot;_blank\&quot; rel=\&quot;noopener\&quot;&gt;registro de profesionales&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;. Si es una renovaci\u00f3n de c\u00e9dula, debes presentar el t\u00edtulo original, el cual ser\u00e1 validado por el o la oficial civil.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Importante&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Revisa como obtenerla si eres &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;[[48168]]\&quot; target=\&quot;_blank\&quot; rel=\&quot;noopener\&quot;&gt;chileno o chilena y te encuentras en el extranjero&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt; o si eres una &lt;a style=\&quot;background-color: white;\&quot; href=\&quot;[[3337]]\&quot; target=\&quot;_blank\&quot; rel=\&quot;noopener\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;persona extranjera&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;La\u00a0c\u00e9dula la puede solicitar tu madre, padre o tutor desde tus primeros d\u00edas de vida. Si eres mayor de 18 a\u00f1os, y vives en el pa\u00eds,\u00a0tienes la obligaci\u00f3n\u00a0de tener tu c\u00e9dula de identidad vigente y en buen estado.\u00a0&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;La c\u00e9dula de identidad para &lt;strong&gt;personas mayores de 80 a\u00f1os y mayores de 60, que tengan dependencia severa&lt;\/strong&gt;, ser\u00e1 emitida con una vigencia de 20 a\u00f1os y podr\u00e1 ser utilizar dentro del territorio nacional.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Si viajas a Argentina, Bolivia, Brasil, Colombia, Ecuador, Paraguay, Per\u00fa o Uruguay, puedes hacerlo solo con tu c\u00e9dula de identidad vigente y en buen estado.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&quot;,&quot;details&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;beneficiaries&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;requirements&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;online&quot;:false,&quot;online_guide&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;online_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;office&quot;:false,&quot;office_guide&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:false,&quot;phone_guide&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;mail&quot;:false,&quot;mail_guide&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;consulate&quot;:0,&quot;consulate_guide&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;legal&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;keywords&quot;:&quot;carn\u00e9, carnet, c\u00e9dula de identidad, carnet de identidad, DNI, bloquedo carne de identidad, bloqueo carnet de identidad, como sacar el carne de identidad, como obtener la cedula de identidad, ver mi cedula de identidad por internet, consultar cedula de identidad, c\u00e9dula de identidad para chilenos, sacar cedula de identidad por internet, estado de cedula de identidad, estado de c\u00e9dula de identidad, renovar carnet de identidad, cedula de identidad vencida, c\u00e9dula de identidad vencida, sacar carnet, sacar carn\u00e9, renovar carn\u00e9, renovar carnet, agendar hora carn\u00e9, agendar hora c\u00e9dula de identidad, reimpresi\u00f3n c\u00e9dula, reimpresi\u00f3n, bloquear c\u00e9dula, bloquear, c\u00e9dula vencida, bloquear c\u00e9dula vencida, reimprimir c\u00e9dula&quot;,&quot;boost&quot;:1,&quot;status&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;status_comment&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;published&quot;:true,&quot;published_at&quot;:&quot;2026-01-19T03:00:00.000000Z&quot;,&quot;master&quot;:true,&quot;master_id&quot;:null,&quot;institution_id&quot;:&quot;AK002&quot;,&quot;correlative&quot;:32,&quot;weight&quot;:0,&quot;cost&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;validity&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;plazo&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;locked&quot;:0,&quot;actualizable&quot;:0,&quot;destacado&quot;:0,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2011-11-25T22:11:14.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-09-11T14:43:01.000000Z&quot;,&quot;genero_id&quot;:1,&quot;convenio&quot;:0,&quot;diagramacion&quot;:3,&quot;cc_id&quot;:&quot;SRCEI0033&quot;,&quot;cc_formulario&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;cc_llavevalor&quot;:47368,&quot;comments&quot;:{&quot;titulo&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;resumen&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;objetivo&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;metaficha_categoria&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;metaficha_servicios&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;metaficha_servicios_no_publican&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;cc_observaciones&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;beneficiarios&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;doc_requeridos&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;guia_online&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;guia_online_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;guia_oficina&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;guia_oficina_nombre&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;guia_telefonico&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;guia_correo&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;guia_chileatiende&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;plazo&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;vigencia&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;costo&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;informacion_multimedia&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;marco_legal&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;objective&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;details&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;beneficiaries&quot